#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Performance {#performance}"
msgstr "Pagganap {#performance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section shows the demonstrated benchmark calculations of HI-VQE with a 24-qubit case for Li2S, a 40-qubit case for an N2 molecule, and a 44-qubit case for an FeP-NO system.\n"
msgstr "Ang seksyong ito ay nagpapakita ng mga ipinahayag na benchmark calculation ng HI-VQE na may 24-qubit na kaso para sa Li2S, isang 40-qubit na kaso para sa isang N2 na molekula, at isang 44-qubit na kaso para sa isang FeP-NO system.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dissociation potential energy surface curve for an Li2S molecule with 24 qubits {#dissociation-potential-energy-surface-curve-for-an-li2s-molecule-with-24-qubits}"
msgstr "Dissociation potential energy surface curve para sa isang Li2S na molekula na may 24 qubit {#dissociation-potential-energy-surface-curve-for-an-li2s-molecule-with-24-qubits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The PES curve is shown with the FCI reference and initial guess from RHF, together with the energy error from the FCI reference.\n"
msgstr "Ang PES curve ay ipinapakita kasama ang FCI reference at paunang hula mula sa RHF, kasama ang energy error mula sa FCI reference.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Image showing that HI-VQE produces solutions within chemical accuracy of a classical reference PES curve for the Li2S system](/docs/images/guides/qunova-chemistry/Li2S_PES.avif).\n"
msgstr "![Larawan na nagpapakita na ang HI-VQE ay gumagawa ng mga solusyon sa loob ng chemical accuracy ng classical reference PES curve para sa Li2S system](/docs/images/guides/qunova-chemistry/Li2S_PES.avif).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The calculations have been conducted with the following geometries and options.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga kalkulasyon ay isinagawa gamit ang mga sumusunod na geometry at opsyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The red dots represent the HI-VQE calculation results for six different geometries, and three geometries corresponding to 1.51, 2.40, and 3.80 Angstrom are provided as input in the above cell.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga pulang tuldok ay kumakatawan sa mga resulta ng HI-VQE calculation para sa anim na iba't ibang geometry, at tatlong geometry na tumutugma sa 1.51, 2.40, at 3.80 Angstrom ang ibinibigay bilang input sa cell sa itaas.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dissociation PES curve for an N2 molecule with 40 qubits {#dissociation-pes-curve-for-an-n2-molecule-with-40-qubits}"
msgstr "Dissociation PES curve para sa isang N2 na molekula na may 40 qubit {#dissociation-pes-curve-for-an-n2-molecule-with-40-qubits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The nitrogen molecule has been identified as a multireference system with large correlation energy contributions beyond the Hartree-Fock state. We conducted a benchmark calculation for the N2 molecule with cc-pvdz basis, (20o,14e) using the homo-lumo active orbital selection. The complete active space (CAS) number to represent this problem is 6,009,350,400. It is not possible to obtain the eigenvalue problem solution (for energy and electronic structure) with this number of states using a powerful desktop (16cpu/64GB). With HI-VQE, users can efficiently search the subspace of CAS states to find chemically accurate results while saving computation resources significantly. The following plots show the PES curve of 40 qubits HI-VQE calculation of the N2 molecule dissociation.\n"
msgstr "Ang nitrogen na molekula ay natukoy bilang isang multireference system na may malalaking kontribusyon ng correlation energy na higit pa sa Hartree-Fock state. Nagsagawa kami ng benchmark calculation para sa N2 na molekula na may cc-pvdz basis, (20o,14e) gamit ang homo-lumo active orbital selection. Ang bilang ng complete active space (CAS) para irepresenta ang problemang ito ay 6,009,350,400. Hindi posible na makuha ang eigenvalue problem solution (para sa energy at electronic structure) na may ganitong bilang ng mga estado gamit ang isang makapangyarihang desktop computer (16cpu/64GB). Sa HI-VQE, maaaring mahusay na hanapin ng mga gumagamit ang subspace ng mga CAS state para mahanap ang mga chemically accurate na resulta habang nananatiling makatipid ng mga computational resource. Ang mga sumusunod na plot ay nagpapakita ng PES curve ng 40-qubit HI-VQE calculation ng dissociation ng N2 na molekula.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Image showing that HI-VQE produces solutions within chemical accuracy of a classical reference PES curve for the N2 system](/docs/images/guides/qunova-chemistry/N2_PES_40qubits.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Larawan na nagpapakita na ang HI-VQE ay gumagawa ng mga solusyon sa loob ng chemical accuracy ng classical reference PES curve para sa N2 system](/docs/images/guides/qunova-chemistry/N2_PES_40qubits.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dissociation PES curve for five-coordinated iron(II)-porphyrin with an NO system with 44 qubits {#dissociation-pes-curve-for-five-coordinated-ironii-porphyrin-with-an-no-system-with-44-qubits}"
msgstr "Dissociation PES curve para sa five-coordinated iron(II)-porphyrin na may NO system na may 44 qubit {#dissociation-pes-curve-for-five-coordinated-ironii-porphyrin-with-an-no-system-with-44-qubits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Another interesting chemical system is an iron(II)-porphyrin (FeP) complex with a coordinated nitric oxide (NO) ligand, which represents a biologically relevant metalloporphyrin system that plays crucial roles in various physiological processes. In this example, HI-VQE has been utilized to estimate the accurate potential energy surface curve of the intermolecular interaction between FeP and NO (ground state energy for differently separated geometries). The combined system has 450 orbitals and 202 electrons (450o,202e) with 6-31g(d) basis in total. The homo-lumo active orbital selection was utilized to calculate the smaller case from the real case with (22o,22e). From the following benchmark results, we were able to achieve the chemical accuracy (>&nbsp;1.6 mHa) with a state-of-the-art classical computer chemistry calculation of CASCI(DMRG) (22o,22e) reference.\n"
msgstr "Isa pang kawili-wiling chemical system ay ang isang iron(II)-porphyrin (FeP) complex na may coordinated nitric oxide (NO) ligand, na kumakatawan sa isang biologically relevant metalloporphyrin system na may mahalagang papel sa iba't ibang physiological process. Sa halimbawang ito, ginamit ang HI-VQE para tantiyahin ang tumpak na potential energy surface curve ng intermolecular interaction sa pagitan ng FeP at NO (ground state energy para sa iba't ibang pinaghiwalay na geometry). Ang pinagsanib na sistema ay may 450 orbital at 202 elektron (450o,202e) na may 6-31g(d) basis sa kabuuan. Ang homo-lumo active orbital selection ay ginamit para kalkulahin ang mas maliit na kaso mula sa tunay na kaso na may (22o,22e). Mula sa mga sumusunod na benchmark result, nakamit namin ang chemical accuracy (>&nbsp;1.6 mHa) kasama ang state-of-the-art classical computer chemistry calculation ng CASCI(DMRG) (22o,22e) reference.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Image showing that HI-VQE produces solutions within chemical accuracy of a classical reference PES curve for the FeP-NO system](/docs/images/guides/qunova-chemistry/fepno_44qubits.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Larawan na nagpapakita na ang HI-VQE ay gumagawa ng mga solusyon sa loob ng chemical accuracy ng classical reference PES curve para sa FeP-NO system](/docs/images/guides/qunova-chemistry/fepno_44qubits.avif)\n"

